isolate ${u}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(u{e}^{-7x})}^{′}+7(u{e}^{-7x}) & ={e}^{-7x} \\\\ {u}^{′}{e}^{-7x}-7u{e}^{-7x}+7u{e}^{-7x} & ={e}^{-7x} \\\\ {u}^{′}{e}^{-7x}-\\cancel{7u{e}^{-7x}}+\\cancel{7u{e}^{-7x}} & ={e}^{-7x} \\\\ {u}^{′}{e}^{-7x} & ={e}^{-7x} \\\\ {u}^{′} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating both sides with respect to $x$ (omitting the arbitrary constant), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′} & =1 \\\\ \\int {u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\,\\text{d}x \\\\ u & =x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since ${y}_{p}=u(x){e}^{-7x},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p} & =u(x){e}^{-7x} \\\\  & =x{e}^{-7x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397069 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397070 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397071 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397072 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397073 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397074 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1077 "field-2" 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397074 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397068 1080 #uuid "abaac5ec-4860-5fab-abd5-9e1c5fafe889" 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397069 1081 "x{e}^{-7x}" 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397069 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397069 1084 #uuid "e403ce47-06c5-5e9b-ab8e-462b81d03f09" 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397070 1081 "{e}^{7x}" 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397070 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533470 17592186045585 true] [17592186397070 1084 #uuid "11a32a7f-7b9c-504f-b1d3-2e76cef86def" 13194139533470 17592186045585 tr